  "statement": "Evaluate $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin^2 x\\,dx$.",
  "solution": "Using $\\sin^2x=\\tfrac12(1-\\cos2x)$, $\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\tfrac12\\left[x-\\tfrac12\\sin2x\\right]_0^{\\pi}=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}$.",
